# The see-creature hooks of Agit01Move1 (a soldier, 35379) and Agit01PartisanSorcerer2 (35380, an
# Agit01Move1), standing 2000 away until the character steps up to them. Seeing the character, the
# soldier wants to attack it by 200; the sorcerer, whose own hook replaces its parent's, wants to
# cast skill 4043 at it from where it stands, weight 1000000, and no attack. The sorcerer's
# template lists 4043 so the fixture server knows the skill.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.Agit01Move1.Agit01Move1
script script.ai.siegablehall.Agit01Move1.Agit01PartisanSorcerer2
npc soldier 35379 Monster 2000 0 0
npc sorcerer 35380 Monster 2000 200 0 skill DD_MAGIC 4043 1

approach soldier
  desires soldier attack(player)=200
  desires sorcerer cast(player,4043)=1000000
